# The record that launches a Structure by name has no argument args (R21, item 4: the formals of a launch are given by
# the receiver call; R22, item 3; plan M11 5b): an argument of another name gives no form -- answer 5.
Bump: (n := n + 1)
A: (int: n 0)
fn: f () int
    Bump(args := A)
    return: A\n
end: f
int: seen f()
